WEBVTT

NOTE Estimate a trip: captions match the on-screen steps.

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.868
Step 1 of 9. Estimate a trip: the 2021 regression runs in your browser, all 579 features of it.

2
00:00:05.868 --> 00:00:08.422
Step 2 of 9. Pick a pickup zone: Penn Station/Madison Sq West.

3
00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:16.917
Step 3 of 9. And a drop-off: Times Sq/Theatre District, on Wednesday 9 October 2019 at 5 pm.

4
00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:22.820
Step 4 of 9. The 2021 model predicts 14.2 min, with a 90% split-conformal interval of 3.9 to 31.5 min.

5
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.600
Step 5 of 9. Riders saw a median of 13.3 min at 5 pm, over 9,856 trips: the dashed blue line.

6
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:35.119
Step 6 of 9. At 95% the interval widens to 3.1 to 36.7 min, and 95.0% of held-out trips like these fell inside.

7
00:00:35.119 --> 00:00:41.551
Step 7 of 9. Change the hour to 8 am: 13.2 min, and the interval moves with the prediction.

8
00:00:41.551 --> 00:00:49.867
Step 8 of 9. Why that number: a linear model is a sum, and each bar is one part of the trip.

9
00:00:49.867 --> 00:01:01.560
Step 9 of 9. How the intervals were checked: coverage on 7.5 million held-out trips, with day-bootstrap CIs.
